WEBVTT

00:00:17.030 --> 00:00:21.370
<b>Chio's</b>

00:00:17.030 --> 00:00:21.370
School Road

00:01:32.320 --> 00:01:36.860
<b>Bloody Butterfly Effect 2</b>

00:01:32.990 --> 00:01:35.150
<i>On mornings when I leave a bit early,</i>

00:01:35.150 --> 00:01:37.670
<i>it's nice to walk through the park sometimes.</i>

00:01:37.670 --> 00:01:39.110
<i>There are so many people...</i>

00:01:42.800 --> 00:01:47.570
<i>Motorcycles... Looks like some gang members.</i>

00:01:43.800 --> 00:01:45.000
What's your problem?!

00:01:47.570 --> 00:01:49.500
<i>They're shouting about something.</i>

00:01:49.500 --> 00:01:51.760
<i>This isn't how I wanted 
to start my morning...</i>

00:01:51.760 --> 00:01:54.960
Well, this park's pretty big, 
so I'll just avoid them...

00:01:53.490 --> 00:01:56.920
I ended up meeting the real deal...

00:01:57.490 --> 00:01:59.670
Um... What's my first period class again?

00:01:59.670 --> 00:02:02.490
The name was... Bloody Butterfly.

00:02:03.210 --> 00:02:03.890
Blo—

00:02:04.100 --> 00:02:07.920
B-Bloody Butterfly? Who is that?

00:02:07.920 --> 00:02:09.770
It's the name of the woman

00:02:10.520 --> 00:02:12.120
who defeated me in a single blow.

00:02:12.600 --> 00:02:14.360
A w-woman?!

00:02:15.260 --> 00:02:16.360
<i>That's the guy from...</i>

00:02:17.260 --> 00:02:18.700
<i>that one time!</i>

00:02:18.200 --> 00:02:19.280
<b>Bloody Butterfly</b>

00:02:21.280 --> 00:02:23.530
I appreciate that you want me to stay,

00:02:23.530 --> 00:02:27.340
but I swore to Bloody Butterfly 
that I'd quit this way of life.

00:02:27.340 --> 00:02:28.200
No way!

00:02:28.200 --> 00:02:29.210
I won't go back on my word.

00:02:29.440 --> 00:02:35.130
<i>Wait... He actually took what 
I said the other day seriously?</i>

00:02:35.620 --> 00:02:38.550
At first, I thought some crazy 
chick was trying to pick a fight,

00:02:38.550 --> 00:02:42.390
but the second she got in my face, 
Bloody Butterfly smirked,

00:02:42.690 --> 00:02:45.930
and before I knew it, I was on the ground.

00:02:46.150 --> 00:02:47.210
No way.

00:02:47.210 --> 00:02:49.560
But you're known as the 
demon god, Andou-san...

00:02:50.040 --> 00:02:52.980
I can't believe it... Bloody Butterfly...

00:02:52.980 --> 00:02:56.440
But I've never heard of this 
Bloody Butterfly chick.

00:02:56.440 --> 00:02:59.700
Bloody Butterfly... 
She must be from some other turf.

00:02:59.700 --> 00:03:03.450
Bloody Butterfly... Maybe her name has 
something to do with a butterfly knife.

00:03:03.450 --> 00:03:07.580
<i>Please stop! Stop saying 
that name over and over!</i>

00:03:07.580 --> 00:03:10.710
<i>Bloody Butterfly is just the 
handle I use for online games!</i>

00:03:10.710 --> 00:03:13.380
<i>When you keep saying it so seriously IRL...</i>

00:03:13.610 --> 00:03:15.790
<i>It's just too embarrassing!</i>

00:03:15.910 --> 00:03:18.710
Guys, don't try to dig too deep.

00:03:19.260 --> 00:03:23.340
Bloody Butterfly is a denizen 
of society's dark underworld.

00:03:23.900 --> 00:03:28.420
I realized something after 
speaking with Bloody Butterfly...

00:03:28.420 --> 00:03:31.270
That what we're doing is child's play.

00:03:32.880 --> 00:03:34.690
Honestly, it was a shock

00:03:34.690 --> 00:03:39.280
to find out there were women like 
Bloody Butterfly in this world.

00:03:40.880 --> 00:03:42.750
To think someone who looked like that

00:03:42.750 --> 00:03:45.160
was fighting with gangs and 
mafias from other countries...

00:03:45.600 --> 00:03:47.420
That's Bloody Butterfly.

00:03:48.280 --> 00:03:52.290
There's someone out there that 
Andou-san has such high praise for?

00:03:52.290 --> 00:03:54.960
No, I just can't accept this.

00:03:55.180 --> 00:03:57.960
I need to see this Bloody Butterfly for myself!

00:03:57.960 --> 00:04:00.670
You dumbass! You don't trust me?

00:04:01.940 --> 00:04:04.220
This is getting way too big!

00:04:04.220 --> 00:04:06.600
If this keeps up, I won't be 
able to walk around town!

00:04:06.870 --> 00:04:10.140
I believe in your strength, Andou-san!

00:04:10.580 --> 00:04:14.110
That's why, even if I have to 
drag Bloody Butterfly out here...

00:04:14.110 --> 00:04:14.810
I'm in.

00:04:15.240 --> 00:04:18.150
She must've used some underhanded trick.

00:04:18.150 --> 00:04:20.730
Otherwise, there's no way 
you'd lose, Andou-san!

00:04:20.890 --> 00:04:24.570
We'll do everything in our power to find her!

00:04:24.570 --> 00:04:27.370
We're gonna hunt down Bloody Butterfly!

00:04:28.830 --> 00:04:30.660
A-Andou-san?

00:04:31.590 --> 00:04:32.110
Um...

00:04:32.110 --> 00:04:33.000
Don't move!

00:04:33.580 --> 00:04:34.840
Don't say a word.

00:04:34.840 --> 00:04:36.880
Whatever you do, don't turn around!

00:04:41.960 --> 00:04:45.220
Wh-Where the hell did you come from,

00:04:46.040 --> 00:04:48.050
Bloody Butterfly?!

00:04:49.140 --> 00:04:51.060
<i>Th-This is...</i>

00:04:52.280 --> 00:04:55.140
<i>Bloody Butterfly?!</i>

00:04:56.450 --> 00:05:00.650
<i>Wait. This is Bloody Butterfly?</i>

00:05:00.650 --> 00:05:04.600
<i>She's nothing like I imagined...</i>

00:05:04.600 --> 00:05:07.410
<i>I thought she'd look more 
like a female commando.</i>

00:05:07.590 --> 00:05:12.910
<i>Yeah, they definitely look disappointed, 
after he built me up so much.</i>

00:05:13.330 --> 00:05:15.870
<i>This should make it a 
little easier to talk...</i>

00:05:15.870 --> 00:05:19.920
What do you want, Bloody Butterfly?

00:05:20.260 --> 00:05:24.260
I need to have a chat with you.

00:05:25.430 --> 00:05:27.840
I want to talk to you alone.

00:05:33.520 --> 00:05:34.930
You guys, stay put.

00:05:36.060 --> 00:05:37.310
I'll be right back.

00:05:38.300 --> 00:05:39.360
Andou-san!

00:05:39.360 --> 00:05:40.640
Just wait there!

00:05:41.230 --> 00:05:44.230
Please don't
toss trash here

00:05:42.350 --> 00:05:45.190
So what did you want to talk about?

00:05:45.570 --> 00:05:47.650
I'm going to leave my gang, 
just like I promised.

00:05:47.650 --> 00:05:49.030
U-Um...

00:05:49.030 --> 00:05:50.910
D-Don't tell me...

00:05:50.910 --> 00:05:53.570
You're trying to drag me 
into the underworld, too!

00:05:53.570 --> 00:05:55.040
Yeah, that!

00:05:56.320 --> 00:05:58.070
You've overestimated me.

00:05:58.070 --> 00:06:02.420
I've never even held a gun, 
let alone killed someone.

00:06:00.920 --> 00:06:02.420
Yeah, that! That!

00:06:02.680 --> 00:06:05.120
I could never bear the 
weight of this country...

00:06:04.390 --> 00:06:06.300
Yeah! About that...

00:06:06.720 --> 00:06:08.660
It's all a misunderstanding!

00:06:12.620 --> 00:06:13.380
Huh?

00:06:13.770 --> 00:06:14.930
That's a natural reaction!

00:06:15.120 --> 00:06:18.990
Um, so basically, there is no 
underground organization or anything.

00:06:18.990 --> 00:06:21.570
I'm just a normal high school girl.

00:06:21.570 --> 00:06:22.860
A below average one.

00:06:25.120 --> 00:06:26.780
No, no, this isn't a joke!

00:06:26.780 --> 00:06:30.820
You see, my leg touched that 
muffler thing on your bike...

00:06:30.820 --> 00:06:31.920
And when I talked about

00:06:31.920 --> 00:06:35.350
guys being crippled for life, 
I just meant they're hooked on gaming...

00:06:39.850 --> 00:06:41.580
<i>He's really bummed about this.</i>

00:06:42.010 --> 00:06:45.350
<i>Actually, I'm glad he understood 
everything pretty quickly.</i>

00:06:45.350 --> 00:06:47.180
<i>The only reason I got through 
this issue last time</i>

00:06:47.180 --> 00:06:50.540
<i>was because he actually 
listened to what I had to say.</i>

00:06:50.540 --> 00:06:52.900
Okay, let me get this straight.

00:06:52.900 --> 00:06:53.610
Okay!

00:06:53.610 --> 00:06:56.600
Basically, you're just some normie

00:06:56.600 --> 00:07:00.440
who was trying to peacefully get by some 
delinquent that was getting in your face...

00:07:01.850 --> 00:07:05.570
Then you managed to completely fool this 
delinquent with your bluffing ability and luck,

00:07:05.970 --> 00:07:09.450
freaked him out, and made him quit his gang.

00:07:09.880 --> 00:07:13.810
And then the delinquent who 
was completely fooled

00:07:13.810 --> 00:07:16.040
went around telling his 
friends about this bluff,

00:07:17.410 --> 00:07:19.760
and now looks like a clown.

00:07:19.760 --> 00:07:21.830
That's what you're saying, right?

00:07:22.030 --> 00:07:24.380
<i>Crap! He's totally going to headbutt me.</i>

00:07:24.710 --> 00:07:25.920
<i>I can't dodge!</i>

00:07:26.810 --> 00:07:29.130
That's freakin' amazing!

00:07:34.030 --> 00:07:36.660
Honestly, I'm at a loss for words.

00:07:38.320 --> 00:07:40.730
Crap. They're going to hear me.

00:07:40.910 --> 00:07:45.450
I see. So you were actually just a normal 
high school girl, just like you look.

00:07:47.970 --> 00:07:52.660
No wonder I thought the name 
Bloody Butterfly was so lame.

00:07:52.990 --> 00:07:57.770
Bloody Butterfly... And I was going on 
about that name with a straight face...

00:07:57.770 --> 00:07:59.850
Bloody Butterfly...

00:08:00.950 --> 00:08:05.180
The point is, I don't want this 
story to spread any further...

00:08:05.180 --> 00:08:06.590
Yeah, yeah, I know.

00:08:06.830 --> 00:08:11.110
Now I don't have any regrets 
in regards to my gang.

00:08:11.460 --> 00:08:14.010
You definitely win.

00:08:14.850 --> 00:08:18.430
So I'm going to continue 
this clown act to the end.

00:08:18.860 --> 00:08:20.550
Come on. Let's head back.

00:08:20.550 --> 00:08:21.390
Huh?

00:08:21.520 --> 00:08:22.780
Wh-What?

00:08:22.780 --> 00:08:23.840
It'll be fine.

00:08:23.840 --> 00:08:25.170
All you need to do is...

00:08:26.500 --> 00:08:28.830
Andou-san's taking a long time.

00:08:29.360 --> 00:08:32.320
It's fine. We don't need to worry about him—

00:08:34.910 --> 00:08:36.200
Andou-san!

00:08:36.460 --> 00:08:40.080
She's... Bloody Butterfly's too dangerous...

00:08:40.080 --> 00:08:41.620
She's too strong!

00:08:42.280 --> 00:08:43.910
What on Earth happened?

00:08:44.790 --> 00:08:45.540
Shit! There she is!

00:08:46.520 --> 00:08:48.750
She's going to kill us all!

00:08:48.750 --> 00:08:50.890
She's a monster!

00:08:50.890 --> 00:08:53.590
<i>Walk slowly... Walk slowly...</i>

00:08:53.920 --> 00:08:55.370
Sh-She's completely unharmed...

00:08:55.370 --> 00:08:57.200
And she beat Andou-san to a pulp?

00:08:57.200 --> 00:08:59.310
Th-This is serious!

00:08:59.310 --> 00:09:00.510
Ah! Butterflies!

00:09:00.740 --> 00:09:02.150
Look out!

00:09:02.150 --> 00:09:06.030
Here comes her special attack 
that she got her name from!

00:09:06.030 --> 00:09:09.380
Everyone within a one-kilometer radius... 
will die, or something!

00:09:10.230 --> 00:09:13.150
Guys, run!

00:09:15.570 --> 00:09:19.070
Make sure you forget this! 
Never mention her name again!

00:09:19.530 --> 00:09:20.990
Don't get involved with her!

00:09:21.470 --> 00:09:23.010
You need to run, too!

00:09:23.010 --> 00:09:24.420
I'm not going to run!

00:09:24.420 --> 00:09:27.290
I'm going to defeat Bloody Butterfly!

00:09:27.290 --> 00:09:30.000
I'm ready to give up my 
life for you, Andou-san—

00:09:30.720 --> 00:09:33.760
I told you to run. I'll kill you!

00:09:43.810 --> 00:09:45.930
That should do it.

00:09:45.930 --> 00:09:48.310
I think we've scared them enough.

00:09:48.510 --> 00:09:51.080
They all left their bikes,

00:09:51.080 --> 00:09:53.560
and they call themselves 
a motorcycle gang...

00:09:53.560 --> 00:09:56.200
Um... Thank you very much!

00:09:58.300 --> 00:10:01.030
Please use this.

00:10:05.870 --> 00:10:09.790
If I take that, things will just 
get even more complicated.

00:10:10.060 --> 00:10:12.340
See ya, Bloody Butterfly.

00:10:13.070 --> 00:10:15.540
Seriously, stop calling me that!

00:10:17.150 --> 00:10:20.540
By the way, remember that story 
about someone coming to school

00:10:20.540 --> 00:10:23.140
on a bike with some motorcycle gang guy?

00:10:23.140 --> 00:10:26.030
Huh? Uh, yeah... What about it?

00:10:26.030 --> 00:10:29.020
Well, apparently, the girl who was on the bike

00:10:29.020 --> 00:10:32.880
with that guy called herself 
"Bloody" something-or-other.

00:10:32.880 --> 00:10:35.680
I could swear I've heard 
that somewhere before...

00:10:36.060 --> 00:10:38.760
Like when I used to play a lot of games...

00:10:38.760 --> 00:10:42.570
<i>Yeah... because I played with 
you under that name a lot.</i>

00:10:42.570 --> 00:10:44.130
Do you know that name, Chio-chan?

00:10:44.670 --> 00:10:46.460
Can't say that I do...

00:10:47.920 --> 00:10:51.000
<i>I'll have to get rid of her next...</i>

00:10:51.410 --> 00:10:54.000
Chio's School Road.

00:10:51.630 --> 00:10:54.000
<b>Chio's</b>

00:10:51.630 --> 00:10:54.000
School Road

00:10:54.590 --> 00:10:58.170
<b>Bloody Butterfly</b>

00:10:56.870 --> 00:10:58.170
<i>He said my handle was lame...</i>

00:10:59.060 --> 00:11:01.550
<i>What's his gang's name, then?</i>

00:10:59.130 --> 00:11:01.550
<b>His name is Andou...</b>

00:11:00.630 --> 00:11:01.550
<b>I wonder if
it'll come up...</b>

00:11:01.550 --> 00:11:03.510
Apparently Andou left the Starry Night Gang

00:11:01.550 --> 00:11:03.510
Seriously? Well, the Starry Night Gang's finished

00:11:01.870 --> 00:11:02.800
<i>This is it!</i>

00:11:03.510 --> 00:11:08.930
<b>Starry Night Gang</b>

00:11:04.370 --> 00:11:08.200
<i>It wasn't just some tryhard name... 
Aw, it's actually kinda cute...</i>

00:11:09.560 --> 00:11:13.940
<b>Kabaddic Four</b>

00:11:11.990 --> 00:11:14.520
Hey, Manana, could you stick 
your arm out for a sec?

00:11:15.960 --> 00:11:16.640
No.

00:11:16.640 --> 00:11:18.070
Aw...

00:11:18.070 --> 00:11:21.480
But I spent all night practicing CQC...

00:11:21.480 --> 00:11:24.070
Seriously, what? Is this because 
of some video game again?

00:11:24.070 --> 00:11:26.370
What would've happened 
if I'd stuck my arm out?

00:11:26.700 --> 00:11:30.950
The action in that game is so cool! 
I kept watching the cut scenes.

00:11:30.950 --> 00:11:35.130
Wow, your youth really is crap-colored.

00:11:35.360 --> 00:11:36.440
Like this, then this.

00:11:36.660 --> 00:11:38.000
Like this, then this.

00:11:38.000 --> 00:11:40.090
Like this, then this. 
When they catch you, go like this.

00:11:40.090 --> 00:11:41.360
What are you doing? The Bon dance?

00:11:41.360 --> 00:11:43.050
What kind of high school girl are—

00:11:45.720 --> 00:11:47.930
Like this, then this!

00:11:49.950 --> 00:11:53.650
Come on. Hurry up and tell me the password 
to your computer's images folder.

00:11:53.650 --> 00:11:55.420
A-Anything but that.

00:11:55.420 --> 00:11:56.940
K-Kill me!

00:11:56.940 --> 00:12:01.740
You know, I swear your athletic 
skills are wasted on you.

00:12:02.640 --> 00:12:05.010
By the way, we have our physical 
fitness test tomorrow.

00:12:05.010 --> 00:12:06.660
What are you going to do this year?

00:12:07.020 --> 00:12:09.090
Maybe I'll fake it again...

00:12:09.090 --> 00:12:11.110
Chio-chan, you're in a sports club,

00:12:11.110 --> 00:12:14.210
and you're athletic, so you 
should just take it seriously.

00:12:14.210 --> 00:12:16.090
No! Once you stand out,

00:12:16.090 --> 00:12:20.010
they'll expect you to do well in sports 
festivals and ball sports tournaments!

00:12:20.220 --> 00:12:23.690
I just want to live in peace...

00:12:23.690 --> 00:12:26.160
Here we go with your 
below average philosophy.

00:12:26.160 --> 00:12:29.850
You're not allowed to mess up 
even once in this country!

00:12:29.850 --> 00:12:32.770
Missing Pet

00:12:30.060 --> 00:12:32.770
Anyway, physical fitness test trivia...

00:12:33.440 --> 00:12:36.640
Don't side jumps just end 
up looking hilarious?

00:12:36.640 --> 00:12:41.610
Can we go back to the fact that you just 
said "physical fitness test trivia"?

00:12:42.010 --> 00:12:43.940
Moving left and right as fast as you can

00:12:43.940 --> 00:12:46.130
just looks like some strange dance.

00:12:46.130 --> 00:12:47.760
Chio-chan, do it as fast as you can.

00:12:47.760 --> 00:12:49.630
Like this. Do you see it?

00:12:49.630 --> 00:12:51.750
Chio-chan, Chio-chan, say, "Kabaddi!"

00:12:51.750 --> 00:12:55.000
Kabaddi! Kabaddi! Kabaddi! Kabaddi!

00:12:56.240 --> 00:12:59.480
You look too perfect doing that! 
You even made the face!

00:12:59.480 --> 00:13:00.920
This is exhausting!

00:13:00.920 --> 00:13:04.570
I don't even know the rules of kabaddi! 
Teach me, Chio-chan!

00:13:04.570 --> 00:13:06.290
I have no idea, either.

00:13:06.290 --> 00:13:08.760
Good morning! You're both so energetic 
first thing in the morning.

00:13:09.250 --> 00:13:10.800
Perfect timing!

00:13:10.800 --> 00:13:11.680
Huh? What is?

00:13:12.190 --> 00:13:13.490
This senpai here...

00:13:13.490 --> 00:13:14.600
Yes.

00:13:14.740 --> 00:13:20.290
I'm the captain of the Samejima Academy 
Kabaddi Club, Kushitori Madoka.

00:13:20.520 --> 00:13:22.740
What? Kabaddi... Club?

00:13:24.270 --> 00:13:25.390
<i>Oh, crap.</i>

00:13:25.390 --> 00:13:29.570
You guys just said to teach you 
the rules of kabaddi, right?

00:13:29.570 --> 00:13:31.370
I heard it, too!

00:13:31.370 --> 00:13:34.520
Well, um, sorry about that...

00:13:34.790 --> 00:13:37.710
No worries. You didn't mean 
anything bad by it, did you?

00:13:37.710 --> 00:13:38.610
No!

00:13:38.610 --> 00:13:41.020
You were just curious 
about kabaddi, right?

00:13:41.020 --> 00:13:42.770
Huh? Uh, yes...

00:13:42.770 --> 00:13:45.320
You want to know the 
rules of kabaddi, right?

00:13:46.450 --> 00:13:47.590
Yes...

00:13:47.590 --> 00:13:50.510
Okay, I'll teach you, then!

00:13:51.110 --> 00:13:52.740
Let's go over here a sec.

00:13:52.740 --> 00:13:54.720
Isn't that great?

00:13:54.720 --> 00:13:57.000
<i>This suddenly turned troublesome.</i>

00:13:57.480 --> 00:14:00.310
Kabaddi! Kabaddi! Kabaddi! Kabaddi!

00:14:00.520 --> 00:14:04.320
The raider continues to yell "Kabaddi!" 
while they're in the enemy circle.

00:14:04.320 --> 00:14:08.200
<i>Wow... She's actually saying, 
"Kabaddi! Kabaddi!" over and over again.</i>

00:14:08.200 --> 00:14:11.120
You touch your opponents 
before you run out of breath.

00:14:11.450 --> 00:14:14.920
When you return to your own side, you get 
points for every opponent you touched.

00:14:14.920 --> 00:14:17.830
The players who were touched are out.

00:14:17.830 --> 00:14:21.640
I see! So the raiders alternate 
heading in one by one,

00:14:21.640 --> 00:14:25.680
and then the other team tries to avoid 
being touched by them, like a game of tag.

00:14:25.680 --> 00:14:26.510
Correct.

00:14:26.510 --> 00:14:28.970
<i>Wow, I totally don't care!</i>

00:14:29.160 --> 00:14:32.490
<i>We actually got stuck in a kabaddi 
lesson on our way to school.</i>

00:14:32.490 --> 00:14:36.930
<i>School's about to start, 
so could you please just let us go?</i>

00:14:36.930 --> 00:14:40.850
The difference between this and tag is 
that defense has a way of scoring, too.

00:14:41.210 --> 00:14:44.480
You capture the raider, like this.

00:14:44.480 --> 00:14:47.780
If you can completely stop their 
movements, the defense gets a point.

00:14:48.100 --> 00:14:50.860
The raiders touch, and the defense catches.

00:14:50.860 --> 00:14:52.150
That's the easiest way to explain it.

00:14:52.150 --> 00:14:53.660
Wow, that's so simple!

00:14:53.660 --> 00:14:54.820
That was a great lesson!

00:14:54.820 --> 00:14:56.780
Okay, why don't we try a practice match?

00:14:56.780 --> 00:14:57.360
Huh?

00:14:57.710 --> 00:14:59.580
If you guys lose, you're joining the club.

00:14:59.580 --> 00:15:00.620
Huh?!

00:15:00.910 --> 00:15:05.940
Well, once we third-years graduate, 
the Kabaddi Club will be short on members.

00:15:05.940 --> 00:15:10.340
I'm so happy that there are first-years 
so interested in kabaddi.

00:15:10.340 --> 00:15:12.140
Er, um...

00:15:12.140 --> 00:15:13.650
I mean...

00:15:13.650 --> 00:15:19.690
you weren't actually making 
fun of kabaddi, were you?

00:15:19.690 --> 00:15:23.530
<i>I see... I was wondering why she was 
explaining everything in so much detail.</i>

00:15:23.530 --> 00:15:24.610
<i>So this is what she was after.</i>

00:15:25.850 --> 00:15:29.240
<i>I guess we owe her that much, 
not to mention she's a third-year,</i>

00:15:29.240 --> 00:15:31.530
<i>so it's hard to say no...</i>

00:15:31.530 --> 00:15:33.560
<i>We might just have to do this.</i>

00:15:33.560 --> 00:15:35.640
All right, you guys are the raiders.

00:15:35.640 --> 00:15:37.020
Okay, go, Manana!

00:15:37.020 --> 00:15:38.250
Wait, me?!

00:15:38.250 --> 00:15:39.370
In order of seat assignment!

00:15:39.690 --> 00:15:41.380
What? Ahem...

00:15:41.380 --> 00:15:46.090
Kaba— K-Kabaddi, kabaddi, 
kaba... kabaddi, kabaddi...

00:15:44.210 --> 00:15:46.090
<i>I just have to touch them 
and turn back, right?</i>

00:15:50.440 --> 00:15:53.350
Now, quit your struggling...

00:15:53.350 --> 00:15:56.180
<i>Wait, what? This is nothing 
like her explanation!</i>

00:15:56.180 --> 00:15:59.810
You can keep trying to run until 
you're completely captured.

00:15:59.810 --> 00:16:01.430
I can't move anymore!

00:16:01.430 --> 00:16:03.060
She's completely serious about this!

00:16:03.420 --> 00:16:04.980
<i>Manana's out.</i>

00:16:03.600 --> 00:16:04.980
<b>Manana Out</b>

00:16:05.550 --> 00:16:09.900
Hey, just so I know...
How do we end this game?

00:16:06.610 --> 00:16:08.920
<b>Once you're out, 
you stand out of bounds</b>

00:16:10.170 --> 00:16:15.070
Usually, there's a time limit where the 
players that are out can come back,

00:16:15.520 --> 00:16:17.580
but we don't have much 
time before school starts,

00:16:17.580 --> 00:16:21.120
so we can end the game as soon 
as one side is completely out.

00:16:21.120 --> 00:16:24.950
<i>Wait, does that mean if I go out, we lose?</i>

00:16:24.950 --> 00:16:26.880
Okay, I'll be raider next!

00:16:27.310 --> 00:16:33.260
Kabaddi! Kabaddi! Kabaddi! Kabaddi! Kabaddi!

00:16:27.530 --> 00:16:31.050
<i>So if Hosokawa-san touches me and she runs,</i>

00:16:31.050 --> 00:16:33.260
<i>we're instantly members of the Kabaddi Club?!</i>

00:16:33.840 --> 00:16:39.520
<i>Yet if I try to catch her, she 
might end up touching me instead.</i>

00:16:39.900 --> 00:16:43.440
<i>Wait... is kabaddi deeper than I thought?</i>

00:16:44.220 --> 00:16:45.850
Kabaddi! Kabaddi! Kabaddi!

00:16:44.380 --> 00:16:45.850
<i>Let's flip this around...</i>

00:16:46.590 --> 00:16:48.810
<i>It might actually be easier 
for me to go through school</i>

00:16:48.810 --> 00:16:51.740
<i>if I quit the Tennis Club and 
join the Kabaddi Club instead.</i>

00:16:53.130 --> 00:16:54.410
Nice to meet you!

00:16:54.410 --> 00:16:56.620
A new class and a new start!

00:16:56.620 --> 00:16:58.760
What club are you in, Miyamo-san?

00:16:58.760 --> 00:17:00.910
Oh, I'm in the Kabaddi Club.

00:17:01.280 --> 00:17:02.020
Kaba (hippo)...

00:17:02.020 --> 00:17:02.900
...D?

00:17:03.210 --> 00:17:04.130
Kabaddi, kabaddi!

00:17:04.130 --> 00:17:05.210
And then...

00:17:05.210 --> 00:17:06.630
Tackle!

00:17:08.270 --> 00:17:08.960
Hey!

00:17:09.160 --> 00:17:10.880
Stop making fun of kabaddi!

00:17:10.880 --> 00:17:13.540
And the one who's supposed 
to tackle is the defense,

00:17:13.540 --> 00:17:15.770
so if you're chanting, you're 
supposed to be a raider!

00:17:15.770 --> 00:17:17.570
M-Miyamo-san?

00:17:17.570 --> 00:17:18.720
The hell are you talking about?

00:17:18.720 --> 00:17:21.520
Kabaddi! Kabaddi! Kabaddi! Kabaddi!

00:17:19.080 --> 00:17:21.520
<i>That's way too much responsibility for me!</i>

00:17:21.520 --> 00:17:24.360
That girl's got some moves...

00:17:25.140 --> 00:17:26.400
I'm out of breath...

00:17:27.360 --> 00:17:30.820
<i>I somehow survived. 
Next is my turn to be the raider...</i>

00:17:31.400 --> 00:17:33.890
<i>I don't have enough stamina 
to do this much longer.</i>

00:17:33.890 --> 00:17:36.740
<i>I have to get these two out on this turn.</i>

00:17:37.480 --> 00:17:38.530
<i>What?</i>

00:17:39.270 --> 00:17:40.600
<i>I can't get serious about this</i>

00:17:40.600 --> 00:17:43.450
<i>because I feel like I'm dealing 
with some mysterious, rare sport.</i>

00:17:43.820 --> 00:17:45.410
<i>I'm going to stake my life on this.</i>

00:17:45.960 --> 00:17:47.880
<i>Game brain, activate!</i>

00:17:48.950 --> 00:17:52.420
<i>I'm going to rewrite kabaddi's 
weird rules into a video game!</i>

00:17:52.740 --> 00:17:56.590
<i>That's right... I have the ability 
to turn those I touch into bombs!</i>

00:17:57.030 --> 00:18:01.050
<i>My mission is to turn those two into 
bombs and then return to safety!</i>

00:18:01.050 --> 00:18:03.850
Better hurry, or you'll be breaking the rules!

00:18:01.050 --> 00:18:03.850
<i>If I'm captured, I'll be tortured and killed!</i>

00:18:04.570 --> 00:18:07.770
<i>There's a spell I need for 
this ability to activate...</i>

00:18:08.360 --> 00:18:09.770
Kabaddi...

00:18:09.770 --> 00:18:11.190
<i>Okay. This works.</i>

00:18:11.190 --> 00:18:15.360
Kabaddi... Kabaddi... Kabaddi... 
Kabaddi... Kabaddi...

00:18:12.620 --> 00:18:14.470
Yuki-chan, be careful.

00:18:14.470 --> 00:18:17.530
Something's changed about her...

00:18:17.530 --> 00:18:19.030
Kabaddi, kabaddi, kabaddi!

00:18:21.780 --> 00:18:24.550
<i>No, she's got some potential, 
but she's still a newbie...</i>

00:18:21.780 --> 00:18:25.660
Kabaddi, kabaddi, kabaddi...

00:18:24.550 --> 00:18:25.660
<i>She's too deep in enemy territory.</i>

00:18:26.070 --> 00:18:28.080
<i>Even if she's able to touch us 
while this deep in our territory,</i>

00:18:28.080 --> 00:18:30.580
<i>she won't be able to escape 
from Yuki-chan and me!</i>

00:18:31.380 --> 00:18:32.250
<i>I've got her back!</i>

00:18:32.820 --> 00:18:33.880
You're wide open!

00:18:34.300 --> 00:18:35.760
Tackle her, Yuki-chan!

00:18:35.760 --> 00:18:36.530
Got it!

00:18:37.130 --> 00:18:39.260
<i>When they catch you, go like this!</i>

00:18:39.940 --> 00:18:42.100
<i>Make them lose their balance!</i>

00:18:42.710 --> 00:18:44.520
I'm not letting go!

00:18:46.000 --> 00:18:48.480
<i>Hosokawa-san is coming at me as straight 
and narrow as her personality is.</i>

00:18:49.110 --> 00:18:51.110
Kabaddi!

00:18:51.550 --> 00:18:54.570
<i>To get her to let go 
of me, I need to do this!</i>

00:19:05.730 --> 00:19:07.710
Um... Kushitori-senpai?

00:19:07.970 --> 00:19:08.550
Um...

00:19:09.650 --> 00:19:10.400
Huh?

00:19:10.400 --> 00:19:12.580
Senpai? Miyamo-san is leaving!

00:19:12.580 --> 00:19:13.610
Huh?

00:19:13.610 --> 00:19:15.500
Kushitori-senpai! 
Your hand, your hand, your hand!

00:19:18.950 --> 00:19:21.300
<i>Mission complete!</i>

00:19:23.580 --> 00:19:28.230
I touched both and made it back. 
That means I win.

00:19:28.440 --> 00:19:30.790
How did you come up with a plan like that?

00:19:30.790 --> 00:19:32.520
Senpai, um, uh...

00:19:33.810 --> 00:19:39.080
When you first tackled Manana and 
I saw your expression, I knew...

00:19:40.080 --> 00:19:41.890
You definitely like girls.

00:19:42.530 --> 00:19:45.610
On top of that, 
when Hosokawa-san was raiding,

00:19:45.610 --> 00:19:49.550
you stared up her skirt 
and couldn't stop smirking.

00:19:49.550 --> 00:19:50.540
What?!

00:19:51.450 --> 00:19:53.240
So when you grabbed me,

00:19:53.240 --> 00:19:55.560
I figured if I led your hand 
toward Hosokawa-san's perineum,

00:19:53.500 --> 00:19:57.170
<b>Perineum
Between the oo and xx</b>

00:19:55.560 --> 00:20:01.090
you'd prioritize touching her 
perineum and let go of me.

00:20:01.360 --> 00:20:06.470
I'm going to declare that you like wrestling 
with girls more than you like kabaddi!

00:20:06.660 --> 00:20:09.890
What are you talking about?! I love kabaddi!

00:20:10.060 --> 00:20:13.810
There's nothing that moves 
my heart as much as kabaddi!

00:20:13.980 --> 00:20:18.190
Then why don't you untangle your 
arm and have another match with me?

00:20:31.120 --> 00:20:34.130
I can't! When I think 
about how many more times

00:20:34.130 --> 00:20:36.680
I might have the chance to 
touch Yuki-chan's perineum...

00:20:36.680 --> 00:20:38.470
My body won't move!

00:20:38.470 --> 00:20:40.370
That's my butt, my butt, my butt!

00:20:40.370 --> 00:20:42.600
I... lose...

00:20:43.780 --> 00:20:48.470
Please let me go!

00:20:49.920 --> 00:20:54.400
You made me realize how much I wasn't 
prepared as a kabaddist today.

00:20:54.400 --> 00:20:57.530
So, uh, I'm sorry... for various things.

00:20:57.530 --> 00:20:58.880
Oh, it's fine.

00:20:58.880 --> 00:21:02.610
Hey, Kushitori-senpai, 
can I ask you a question?

00:21:02.610 --> 00:21:03.320
Sure.

00:21:03.620 --> 00:21:06.240
How can I get my boobs to be that big?

00:21:06.850 --> 00:21:10.610
<i>I'm surprised she had the nerve to 
ask something like that right now.</i>

00:21:10.610 --> 00:21:12.160
<i>Maybe she is sick in the head.</i>

00:21:12.320 --> 00:21:15.870
Actually, now that you ask me that,

00:21:16.200 --> 00:21:20.530
I have a feeling my body was pretty 
normal before I started kabaddi...

00:21:20.530 --> 00:21:22.670
Huh? But then what happened?

00:21:23.390 --> 00:21:26.840
Kabaddi comes from India,

00:21:26.840 --> 00:21:30.510
and it's said that some of the 
movements incorporate yoga.

00:21:30.920 --> 00:21:36.440
It could be that the yoga involved in 
the sport had an effect on my body...

00:21:40.570 --> 00:21:44.490
Kabaddi! Kabaddi! K-Kabaddi! 
Kabaddi! Kabaddi!

00:21:41.890 --> 00:21:44.490
Kabaddi! Kabaddi! Kabaddi! Kabaddi! Kabaddi!

00:21:44.530 --> 00:21:47.490
<b>Chio's</b>

00:21:44.530 --> 00:21:47.490
School Road

00:21:45.220 --> 00:21:47.050
Chio's School Road.

00:21:47.980 --> 00:21:49.850
<i>More... More...</i>

00:21:50.160 --> 00:21:52.780
<i>I need to devote myself to the 
ways of kabaddi even more!</i>

00:21:53.280 --> 00:21:54.080
<i>But...</i>

00:21:54.820 --> 00:21:56.500
<i>Yuki-chan's butt...</i>

00:21:56.500 --> 00:21:59.920
Kabaddi! Kabaddi! Kabaddi! Kabaddi! Kabaddi!

00:23:29.930 --> 00:23:39.940
<b>Next Episode Preview</b>

00:23:30.360 --> 00:23:32.240
Next time on <i>Chio's School Road</i>,

00:23:32.240 --> 00:23:34.950
"Smoke on the Sailor," 
"Taking the Cherry Blossom in Your Hand,"

00:23:34.950 --> 00:23:37.770
and "Manana's School Road."

00:23:37.770 --> 00:23:38.860
Look forward to it!

00:23:38.860 --> 00:23:39.940
Kabaddi!
